  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186059848,
      "id": "32df8909-a239-5167-b8ea-412f7cdaea93",
      "title": "Identifying Singular Matrices"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "897a51e1-d192-5404-a356-16f3afeaf646",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $F$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $F$ is a singular matrix\n- **II.** $F$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- **III.** $det(F)=- \\frac{15}{2}$\n\n$$\nF=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & 1 & 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & 2 & \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & - \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(F) & =|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & 1 & 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & 2 & \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & - \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4})|\\begin{aligned}2 & \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\\end{aligned}|+(-1)|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\\end{aligned}|+2 \\sqrt{2}|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & 2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4})(- \\frac{16 \\sqrt{2}}{3}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3})+(-1)(\\frac{4}{3}- \\frac{4}{3})+2 \\sqrt{2}(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{8}- 2 \\sqrt{2}) \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4})\\cdot (- 5 \\sqrt{2})+(-1)\\cdot 0+2 \\sqrt{2}\\cdot (- \\frac{15 \\sqrt{2}}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{2}- \\frac{15}{2} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(F)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement I is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3899cbb4-cbdb-5da0-9547-a5719853c25a",
